README.md
Dockerfile
.dockerignore

# Runtime upload files - kept in the persistent `backend-uploads` volume,
# NOT baked into the image (seeded separately). Adding `uploads` here keeps
# the build context lean and avoids shipping user data inside the image.
uploads

